Don't believe everything you read.  The rumor that claims that a Crysknife
is the best weapon is a false one.  (It's about on par with a long sword
or katana, more or less.)  A unicorn horn's most useful feature (as a
weapon) is that it's rustproof.  An athame won't be dulled by engraving.
A scalpel is practically useless--just a sharp dagger.

Regarding firing arrows & such:  according to a comment in the sources--I
didn't check the code to confirm that it matches the comment--if you use the
proper "propellor" to launch a missile (ie, bow & arrow, sling & rock, etc),
you get a damage bonus based on that propellor rather than on your strength.
Wielding a bow and then "throwing" an arrow is the correct technique.


